all(Name(\"isinstance\"), (Name(\"x\"), Name(\"int\")))\n                 , Call(Name(\"isinstance\"), (Name(\"y\"), Name(\"int\")))\n                 , Call(Name(\"isinstance\"), (Name(\"z\"), Name(\"int\")))\n                 , BoolOp(\n                     \"or\",\n                     ( Compare(BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"x\"), Name(\"y\")), CmpOp(\"==\", Name(\"z\")))\n                     , Compare(BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"x\"), Name(\"z\")), CmpOp(\"==\", Name(\"y\")))\n                     , Compare(BinOp(\"+\", Name(\"y\"), Name(\"z\")), CmpOp(\"==\", Name(\"x\")))\n                     )\n                   )\n                 )\n               )\n             ) .Stmts,\n             0\n           ),\n         parent(-1)\n       )\n\n  // The mathematical predicate named by the HumanEval contract.\n  syntax Bool ::= anySum(Int, Int, Int) [function, total]\nendmodule\n\nmodule VERIFICATION\n  imports MPY\n  imports VERIFICATION-SYNTAX\n\n  // Derived from the two exhaustive fixed-semantics equations\n  // boolAsInt(true) = 1 and boolAsInt(false) = 0.\n  rule boolAsInt(B:Bool)\n    => #if B #then 1 #else 0 #fi\n    [simplification]\n\n  rule anySum(X:Int, Y:Int, Z:Int)\n    => ((X +Int Y) ==Int Z)\n       orBool ((X +Int Z) ==Int Y)\n       orBool ((Y +Int Z) ==Int X)\nendmodule\nrequires \"verification.k\"\n\nmodule SPEC\n  imports VERIFICATION\n\n  // These eight claims cover every combination accepted by isinstance(_, int)\n  // in the supplied semantics: unbounded Int values and both Bool values.\n  claim [int-int-int]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Int, Y:Int, Z:Int) => ?R:Bool </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    ensures ?R ==Bool anySum(X, Y, Z)\n\n  claim [int-int-bool]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Int, Y:Int, Z:Bool) => ?R:Bool </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    ensures ?R ==Bool anySum(X, Y, boolAsInt(Z))\n\n  claim [int-bool-int]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Int, Y:Bool, Z:Int) => ?R:Bool </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    ensures ?R ==Bool anySum(X, boolAsInt(Y), Z)\n\n  claim [int-bool-bool]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Int, Y:Bool, Z:Bool) => ?R:Bool </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    ensures ?R ==Bool anySum(X, boolAsInt(Y), boolAsInt(Z))\n\n  claim [bool-int-int]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Bool, Y:Int, Z:Int) => ?R:Bool </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    ensures ?R ==Bool anySum(boolAsInt(X), Y, Z)\n\n  claim [bool-int-bool]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Bool, Y:Int, Z:Bool) => ?R:Bool </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    ensures ?R ==Bool anySum(boolAsInt(X), Y, boolAsInt(Z))\n\n  claim [bool-bool-int]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Bool, Y:Bool, Z:Int) => ?R:Bool </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    ensures ?R ==Bool anySum(boolAsInt(X), boolAsInt(Y), Z)\n\n  claim [bool-bool-bool]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Bool, Y:Bool, Z:Bool) => ?R:Bool </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n    ensures ?R ==Bool anySum(boolAsInt(X), boolAsInt(Y), boolAsInt(Z))\n\n  // A Float is not an int.  Short-circuiting means later arguments remain\n  // arbitrary values once the first failing isinstance check is reached.\n  claim [float-any-any]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Float, Y:Val, Z:Val) => false </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n\n  claim [int-float-any]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Int, Y:Float, Z:Val) => false </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n\n  claim [bool-float-any]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Bool, Y:Float, Z:Val) => false </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n\n  claim [int-int-float]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Int, Y:Int, Z:Float) => false </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n\n  claim [int-bool-float]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Int, Y:Bool, Z:Float) => false </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n\n  claim [bool-int-float]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Bool, Y:Int, Z:Float) => false </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n\n  claim [bool-bool-float]:\n    <k> AnyIntCall(X:Bool, Y:Bool, Z:Float) => false </k>\n    <env> 0 </env>\n    <scopes> 0 |-> anyIntModuleScope\n              -1 |-> builtinsScope </scopes>\n    <scopeLoc> 1 </scopeLoc>\n    <heap> .Map </heap>\n    <heapLoc> 0 </heapLoc>\n    <stack> .List </stack>\n    <ret> noRet </ret>\n    <exc> NoExc </exc>\n    <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\nendmodule\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fb0ff-6571-72c3-8497-c8f1534a4c25"}}}
